      pkg figures-on-ethnic-minority-women-and-men-in-vietnam-2015-2019-from-the-findings-of-surveys-on-the-s: Figures on ethnic minority women and men in Vietnam 2015-2019. From the findings
          notes: The report Figures on Ethnic Minority Women and Men in Viet Nam 2015-2019 presents gender analysis and highlights gender outcomes, and provide policy recommendations for gender equality promotion in ethnic minority areas in Viet Nam. Data in the reports were analysed based on the Survey on the Socio-economic Situation of the 53 Ethnic Minority Groups in Viet Nam, which was conducted by the General Statistics Office in collaboration with CEMA in 2015 and 2019.
